<h1 class="libtitle">Library UniMath.CategoryTheory.Limits.Graphs.Limits</h1>

<div class="code">
</div>

<div class="doc">
*************************************************

<div class="paragraph"> </div>

Contents:

<div class="paragraph"> </div>

<ul class="doclist">
<li> Definition of limits

</li>
<li> Proof that limits form a property in a (saturated/univalent) category (<span class="inlinecode"><a class="idref" href="UniMath.CategoryTheory.Limits.Cats.Limits.html#isaprop_Lims"><span class="id" title="lemma">isaprop_Lims</span></a></span>)

</li>
<li> Pointwise construction of limits in functor precategories <span class="inlinecode"><a class="idref" href="UniMath.CategoryTheory.Limits.Cats.Limits.html#LimsFunctorCategory"><span class="id" title="lemma">LimsFunctorCategory</span></a></span>

</li>
<li> Alternative definition of limits via colimits

</li>
</ul>

<div class="paragraph"> </div>

Written by: Benedikt Ahrens and Anders Mörtberg, 2015-2016

<div class="paragraph"> </div>


</div>
